{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB旅遊節目《潮什麼》系列主持梁芷珮（Christy），經常與老公、仔女出埠旅行拍攝節目，生活相當寫意。</p><p>早年，她曾公開家族有青光眼遺傳病史，經檢查後臨「擲界」邊緣，其後又發現子宮內有一個約4厘米大的肌瘤，決定以中醫調理治療。</p><p>&lt;br/</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:23:55.643777+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:01:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:17:13.376068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T10:17:13.376068+00:00","content_hash":"7a88f0c1db4167a3c171aba75fcd6acdef9b4527ef772137fc29bc19ea6207d2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}